<title>HONG KONG: Banque Indosuez appoints new investment chief.</title>
<headline>Banque Indosuez appoints new investment chief.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Banque Indosuez said in a statement on Saturday it had appointed Erh Fei Liu as head of investment banking for the Asia-Pacific.</p>
<p>The Hong Kong-based newly-created position has been effective since January 1, 1997, and Erh Fei Liu reports directly to Jean-Claude Gruffat, chairman of Asia-Pacific.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 28436441</p>
